Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Put staff photos front and center

- New Avatar component: shows a staff photo, falls back to initials if missing
- HR Team roster is now photo-led cards with the mood face as a corner badge
- Employee week view gets a large profile photo, name and job title
- Check-in screen and top-bar user chip show the person's own photo
